{"id":"wt_c5_08","name":"远行前的准备","des":"大书院新街的本诺教授将要远行，想要冰莲火腿三明治作为便携食物。准备 2 份面粉、1 份冰莲和 1 份肉类，即可在营地烹饪出冰莲火腿三明治。","des2":"噢，我很快就要外出进行科研考察了。虽然不知道要去多久，但时间肯定是在两天以上。在这期间我们要在野外度日，肯定是没法架锅烧菜了，只能吃那些如铁石般硬的烂肉干，角布林都不愿意啃的玩意。要吃冷食我也要吃好的，请给我带个冰莲火腿三明治过来吧。","type":3,"typeLabel":"委托","typeOrder":2,"subRaw":"C5","subLabel":"霜烬平原","subKey":"C5","close":false,"reward":{"entries":[{"kind":"money","name":"银币","count":700,"rawMin":700,"rawMax":700,"min":700,"max":700,"countMin":700,"countMax":700,"typeId":"item_00001","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"霜烬平原纪念币","count":7,"rawMin":7,"rawMax":7,"min":7,"max":7,"countMin":7,"countMax":7,"typeId":"item_29105","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_29105.webp","quality":4,"groupIndex":1,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"莲香肉干","count":1,"rawMin":1,"rawMax":2,"min":1,"max":2,"countMin":1,"countMax":2,"typeId":"item_30051","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_30051.webp","quality":3,"groupIndex":2,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1}],"text":[]},"startLocation":"大书院·新街（霜烬平原）","startNpc":{"name":"博物系教授本诺","id":"cart_at_npc_Benno"},"getTask":{"npc":{"name":"博物系教授本诺","id":"cart_at_npc_Benno","line":"","kind":"cart"},"title":"博物系教授本诺","dialog":{"raw":"提交 1 份冰莲火腿三明治。","isText":true,"name":""},"condition":"开启永冻之渊委托（完成主线《向那皑皑雪原》）"},"predecessorTasks":[],"addTasks":[],"unlockTasks":[],"unlockStages":[],"steps":[{"index":1,"name":"提交 1 份冰莲火腿三明治，交给博物系教授本诺。","des":"大书院新街的本诺教授将要远行，想要冰莲火腿三明治作为便携食物。准备 2 份面粉、1 份冰莲和 1 份肉类，即可在营地烹饪出冰莲火腿三明治。","type":"getItemNpc","typeName":"提交道具给NPC","reward":{"entries":[],"text":[]},"unlockStages":[],"unlockSuppressed":false,"detail":[{"label":"说明","value":"提交后扣除道具"},{"label":"NPC","value":"博物系教授本诺"},{"label":"房间","value":"大书院·新街（霜烬平原）"},{"label":"交互对话","value":"（提交冰莲火腿三明治。）"}],"dialogs":[{"label":"不满足条件","meta":{"raw":"wt_c5_08_1_n","isText":fal